---
layout: base.njk
title: Artykuły
description: Poradniki i aktualności dla Polaków mieszkających i pracujących w Belgii.
pageKey: articles
permalink: /artykuly/index.html
---

<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="articles.eyebrow">Baza wiedzy</span>
    <h1 data-i18n="articles.title">Artykuły i poradniki</h1>
    <p data-i18n="articles.description">Formalności, praca, zdrowie i codzienne życie w Belgii — prosto i po polsku.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-list">
    {% set articles = collections.articles | reverse %}
    {% for article in articles %}
    <article class="article-row {% if loop.index0 % 2 == 1 %}article-row--reverse{% endif %}" data-region="{{ article.data.region or 'all' }}">
      <a class="article-row__image" href="{{ article.url }}" aria-label="Czytaj: {{ article.data.title }}" data-article-image-link>
        <img src="{{ article.data.image or '/images/hero.jpg' }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
      </a>
      <div class="article-row__content">
        <div class="article-meta">
          <span class="tag" data-category>{{ article.data.category or "Poradnik" }}</span>
          <time datetime="{{ article.date }}">{{ article.date | readableDate }}</time>
        </div>
        <h2><a href="{{ article.url }}" data-translation-en="{{ article.data.title_en }}" data-translation-nl="{{ article.data.title_nl }}" data-translation-fr="{{ article.data.title_fr }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p data-translation-en="{{ article.data.description_en }}" data-translation-nl="{{ article.data.description_nl }}" data-translation-fr="{{ article.data.description_fr }}">{{ article.data.description }}</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="{{ article.url }}"><span data-i18n="articles.read">Czytaj artykuł</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-state">
      <h2 data-i18n="articles.emptyTitle">Pierwsze artykuły są w przygotowaniu</h2>
      <p data-i18n="articles.emptyText">Zajrzyj tu ponownie już wkrótce.</p>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
